## Action Items for Assignment 7

1. **Clean up color-switching cone obstacle.** This includes providing a clear outline to the player for the time they have been the cones turning on/off and showing where the disabled cones are so the player knows where they can move to next to advance.

2. **Clean up rolling bridge obstacle.** There needs to be an indication that the bridge is rotating, so something like a sign can be added onto the bridge so its movement would inform the player of the rotation.

3. **Clean up the UI.** This includes ensuring that the player is informed of all controls for the game accurately

4. **Clean up the camera jitter.** The camera is still jittery when the character moves any direction but forwards, so hopefully we can work on making this smoother

